  "raw_label": "postponed_or_procedural",
  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Hotel Invitation vs State Of Chhattisgarh on 13 September, 2024 1/4 High Court Of Chhattisgarh At Bilaspur Wpc No. 4618 of 2024 1. Hotel Invitation A Partnership Firm Registered Under The Relevant Provisions Of The Partnership Act, Through Its Partner Namely Harish Kumar Golchha, S/o Anand Raj Golchha, Aged About 50 Years, R/o Hospital Ward, Kondagaon, District Kondagaon, C.G. ... Petitioner Versus 1. State Of Chhattisgarh Through Secretary, Urban Administration And Development, Mahanadi Bhawan, Mantralaya, Capital Complex, Atal Nagar, Nawa Raipur, District - Raipur, C.G. 2. Secretary Labour Department, Mahanadi Bhawan, Mantralaya, Capital Complex, Atal Nagar, Nawa Raipur, District Raipur, C.G. 3. Municipal Council Kondagaon Through Its Chief Municipal Officer, Kondagaon, District-Kondagaon,C.G. 4. Chief Municipal Officer Municipal Council Kondagaon, District Kondagaon, C.G. 5. Deputy Director Town And Country Planning, Jagdalpur, District Jagdalpur, C.G. 6. Inspector Saman Parishramik Adhiniyam 1986 Kondagaon, District Kondagaon, C.G. 7. Inspector Bal And Kishore Shram (Prati V.) Adhiniyam 1986 8. Inspector Minimum Wages Act, 1984 9. Inspector Chhattisgarh Shop And Establishment Act, 1958 10. Collector Kondagaon, District Kondagaon, C.G. 2/4 11. Sub Divisional Officer (Revenue) Kondagaon, District Kondagaon, C.G. 12. Food Safety Officer Khadya And Aushadhi Prashashan Kondagaon, District Kondagaon, C.G. 13. Incharge Of Police Station Kondagaon District Kondagaon, C.G. ...Respondents Order Sheet 13/09/2024 Mr. Manoj Paranjpe, Advocate for the Petitioner. Mr. Vinay Pandey, Dy. Advocate General for the Respondents No. 1 & 2, 5 to 13/State. Mr. Sandeep Dubey, Advocate along with Ms. Pragati Kaushik, Advocate for the Respondents No. 3 & 4. Hotel Invitation vs State Of Chhattisgarh on 13 September, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/193069553/ 1 Heard on admission. Issue notice to respondents.",
    "facts": "Hence, no process fee is required to be paid for issuance of notice to this Respondents.",
    "arguments": "He contended that the Executing Court has passed an order on 26.07.2024 for issuing Kurki warrant and the date fixed for the report of the Kurki warrant was 30.08.2024. The action of the sealing has been done prior to the issuance of notice and submission of the reply. The entire business of the petitioner has been closed and therefore, till the respondents file reply, direction be issued for unsealing of the hotel."
  },
